#: scenario7:scenario7_99EEECE2_ECCA_47E9_9341_77F7239EB190
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f682bfeb44d468458c0b66b5105cc4943be7eb1aaffd259f69064d976687c7a8
#. default-sha256: ac3a0aeacfa1eada43be974840bc858393778677fe498207113bdc4cac1fd062
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_99EEECE2_ECCA_47E9_9341_77F7239EB190"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Sitting in the carriage waiting outside, "
"listening to the ⟪k:11⟫pitter patter⟪k:12⟫ of the rain, I gazed out at my two brothers."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫En m’asseyant dans la voiture qui "
"attendait à l’extérieur, je contemplai mes deux frères, tout en écoutant le clapotement de la "
"pluie."

#: scenario7:scenario7_10D7A1F4_5DCA_408C_ABC8_640CB5DF83DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c38fbb7d18809a9b0aca5b8d0c17689c59f7611abef4ff7c586e91e1c760e357
#. default-sha256: 791cb8eb334609f9767c0578a7e360a4b3d968fb1e3f66f567ba6dccb18c5304
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_10D7A1F4_5DCA_408C_ABC8_640CB5DF83DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I hadn’t seen them in two years, but they hardly looked any different than how I remembered "
"them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Cela faisait deux ans que je ne les avais pas vus, mais ils ne semblaient pas très "
"différents de mon souvenir."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2EA95ABB_F168_436E_B99F_3AC93C2BA29A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d3507e4c19e920078acd76c1a37b54a56526ee126fc0b0a15a3d95f08569d2f
#. default-sha256: 7ddb92a59304770b24f35a9070b335a87b02940b6a987c2f659e87badde9cda6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2EA95ABB_F168_436E_B99F_3AC93C2BA29A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was the only one who had changed—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and dramatically, at that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’étais le seul à avoir changé —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ et radicalement, on peut le dire."

#: scenario7:scenario7_0692BDB2_6F38_4DA8_96DC_2DB7EF2CF8FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15efc6b26ba141006e7c16626579f08b9f010d11b39e3f05854c945f9c9e133a
