msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4077FCB7_CA33_461C_927B_AF968C0A6F3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23b6b2eafe0f767de8263a1935bacdb41e5608ec27e9370c427611856812ebec
#. default-sha256: 689839e28e7b026fea4aa3e1266fd50e80c6fc725cc5e7db263f622b4a9162d5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4077FCB7_CA33_461C_927B_AF968C0A6F3F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If there’s anything you want, Michel, just tell me.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Now, ⟪k:4⟫or you can have "
"a servant pass a message on to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Si tu veux quoi que ce soit d’autre, Michel, dis-le-moi.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dès maintenant, ⟪k:4⟫"
"ou alors tu peux aussi demander à un serviteur de faire passer le message."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C2CEF67B_A24F_4EBC_8DC2_CE4EC03D5CB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2eaa815c645e3cd9f5e017a421ee3794f7ff877f646d33c14f3f09767146f565
#. default-sha256: 8d8308d5c1ded6d8236a6aaa3e25db6b97d0efbd3a8c5de3c45ed7ed63ff52f5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C2CEF67B_A24F_4EBC_8DC2_CE4EC03D5CB3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I can’t think of— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Actually, ⟪k:4⟫wait, ⟪k:5⟫I ⟪k:6⟫can⟪k:7⟫ think of one "
"thing.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I would like a chess set..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Rien ne me v— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫En fait, ⟪k:4⟫non, attends, ⟪k:5⟫il y a bien ⟪k:6⟫une⟪k:7⟫ "
"chose que j’aimerais avoir.⟪k:8⟫ J’aimerais un jeu d’échecs..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_505C1968_149F_4518_99EF_C72F7BA41284
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e76ecd0670425658d1391a316d342085ec49dc74ede44ce1ca234210cec976f0
#. default-sha256: 1219ea5cee31aabd9a44626e85990753b6ff79294b9ca6abef52fb4b6260eecd
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_505C1968_149F_4518_99EF_C72F7BA41284"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All right. I’ll have one made—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Très bien. Je peux t’en faire fabriquer un—"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A699E8CB_FB72_4F79_8085_CB554C20E25D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3442046ab2d871166ccc29e2cdd2f8a5f8ffadb8531f2c292208f8821ea2ad7c
#. default-sha256: 974a56f18fb739dec52f32f8cc0d85594c1c5d37f59d64a544dc296ada081ce9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A699E8CB_FB72_4F79_8085_CB554C20E25D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I would rather have... ⟪k:2⟫yours, Didier.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Would that be possible...?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Je préfèrerais avoir... ⟪k:2⟫le tien, Didier.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Est-ce que ce serait "
"possible... ?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_41BD96CA_D881_46D5_A6B2_B6C97E613885
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d85156d7ce13d8d3c3c4f9a947acb4beefb75751488c2203097f6f71290c79b0
#. default-sha256: f9bbd7dca0fa6395ee791922a90e7bd231f54f9129a84437a4fec6635a378a45
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_41BD96CA_D881_46D5_A6B2_B6C97E613885"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Are you sure you want that beaten old thing?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Es-tu sûr de vouloir ce vieux modèle tout usé ? Il a bien vécu."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C6A44EC2_D2EC_4509_8D70_4310041CC0E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: acda395634fd67deb65117580f0434a19adfaafa07c10794cc250ef0d7e83358
#. default-sha256: 4c07925f2cd7e73a7ecd4078179fcb50417c2a707a2a05bf57a7d8821687e771
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C6A44EC2_D2EC_4509_8D70_4310041CC0E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Yes, I want that one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Oui, c’est celui que je veux."

#: scenario7:scenario7_77193580_493C_4B1C_B164_DF42D5A5400F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f955edabf261aa9690919cbfad08c47d8e851d9502f0e630dd9d13722c47bba0
#. default-sha256: bdc703cb87c8387fb4cdc95d38dd1dc9e4a5b9d183c6a623a76d9bf8b13873ce
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_77193580_493C_4B1C_B164_DF42D5A5400F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...All right, then. I’ll include it in the first delivery."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Très bien. Je te le mettrai dans la première livraison."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FD276F4D_E5F0_4568_95EC_1F7EC24345C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78efbb969761d006c0eddfd1ac88c624c24e98c749d8f0168c9e11ca47c6b9de
#. default-sha256: a1bd0627c7bee1c7776fa0f755c7999b3cf77953adbdda1ec24fe410f10b427a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FD276F4D_E5F0_4568_95EC_1F7EC24345C0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’ll send you something too, Michel.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Anything you want, just tell me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Je t’enverrai aussi quelque chose, Michel.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Tout ce que tu voudras, "
"dis-moi juste."

#: scenario7:scenario7_AC12B8FE_305D_44C1_8A8C_2B831305A787
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f0ad72c744160196c1a5f6883327427d7143edeb5e966eee974d3ca59e436dd
#. default-sha256: 7d9798d4af4dd7b7593d8073917fec009f06c540eee0f4d8c414fb4ee46dd6f0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AC12B8FE_305D_44C1_8A8C_2B831305A787"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫In that case... ⟪k:5⟫I would like some art tools.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"I’m nowhere near as much of an artist as you are,⟪k:8⟫Georges, so they don’t have to be anything "
"special."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Dans ce cas... ⟪k:5⟫j’aimerais de quoi dessiner.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Je "
"suis loin d’avoir ton niveau, d’être un artiste comme toi,⟪k:8⟫donc tu n’es pas obligé de prendre "
"de la qualité."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6B063F2C_3FEE_4909_821D_945E81EB97D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ebfbf164ee4b4b631b8e4a4b666bf933ac752e6afee7c5ed41feae1a032c00a
#. default-sha256: 8361dfb534b80281e3299f6127b5b4a2d1501bb3f619629d2d06a91098827821
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6B063F2C_3FEE_4909_821D_945E81EB97D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Gotcha. So some canvas and, ⟪k:2⟫hmm... ⟪k:3⟫how ’bout some charcoal?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫And when "
"you’re back, I want to see what you’ve made with it, okay?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Bien reçu. Donc quelques toiles, ⟪k:2⟫hmm... ⟪k:3⟫et pourquoi pas du fusain ?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫"
"Quand tu seras de retour, je veux voir ce que tu en auras fait, d’accord ?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_773BFE2C_EEBA_4DAA_89F6_C6732E4E9AA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ae18495eb85b7fb77ece6751e87d22511e29352ce6f989b082374876bd905fb0
#. default-sha256: f07da1ead35860bc0a50f49bc0167f8204cc7a5da5f0c6fda9f8d45dad76d0a5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_773BFE2C_EEBA_4DAA_89F6_C6732E4E9AA9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Okay."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫D’accord."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1A34B477_352D_4260_8109_F961EDAD8409
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0b0787e9ea596f59f8f87414acac9d161321326b4a85e4e60e7b79ead22f188
#. default-sha256: 8d81e9b5b093ccb628dbde11cd6867b8ee20048bdfbd937fc65a466fa4ac549f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1A34B477_352D_4260_8109_F961EDAD8409"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I know this is already hard enough on you, Michel...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫but I need "
"to ask you to do something for me.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Avoid making contact with anyone who doesn’t already "
"know about you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Je sais que c’est déjà bien assez difficile pour toi, Michel...⟪k:5⟫"
"⟪k:6⟫...mais je vais devoir te demander de faire quelque chose pour moi.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫D’éviter tout "
"contact avec ceux qui ne te connaissent pas déjà."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3C6A4E98_1E6E_47E0_81AE_514B9EECE399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f51129a493937f0a16f63a31a5882d280e13107ddae3da4133367cb16005d86
#. default-sha256: 8e492eab84acdb4ee5637184e641430c7dab341ff84759662e2f4368588152ed
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3C6A4E98_1E6E_47E0_81AE_514B9EECE399"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So... ⟪k:2⟫I can’t talk to anybody but the servants?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Alors... ⟪k:2⟫je ne pourrai parler à personne d’autre à part les serviteurs ?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0093026E_84C6_4E0C_B5AE_68C8DD4C7C2E
